    "system": {
        "id": "tricksters-hand",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Free Action\" aria-label=\"Free Action\">0</span></p><p><em>You execute your acts of skulduggery with such subtlety and dexterity that your marks struggle to follow.</em></p><p>Spend 2 focus to gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">2</span>, which you can only use to make physical skill tests via the following actions: @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.A4fgvQ6HoxCIpxFS]{Use a Skill}, @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage}, or an action from any @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.qqa1ZgA957Cae6ex]{Agent} talent.</p><p>During a conversation or endeavor, at the GM’s discretion, you can instead use both <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">2</span> to make an additional contribution for the round.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">0</span></p><p>Spend 2 focus to gain <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">2</span> for physical tests with @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.A4fgvQ6HoxCIpxFS]{Use a Skill}, @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage}, or an @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.qqa1ZgA957Cae6ex]{Agent} talent.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Free Action\" aria-label=\"Free Action\">0</span></p><p>Spend 2 focus to gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">2</span>, which you can only use to make physical skill tests via the following actions: @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.A4fgvQ6HoxCIpxFS]{Use a Skill}, @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage}, or an action from any @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.qqa1ZgA957Cae6ex]{Agent} talent.</p><p>During a conversation or endeavor, at the GM’s discretion, you can instead use both <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">2</span> to make an additional contribution for the round.</p>"
        },
